ShowIgfData mIgfCode
ShowIpgData mIgfIpgCode
ShowPatData mIgfPttCode

Rem old values
Call StoreIgfOldData
Call StoreIpgOldData
Call StorePatOldData

Call ShowEntryMode(True)
txtPttName.SetFocus

End Sub

